  unitName: King Behemoth
  unitId: 40113
  unitNumber: 145
  description: A beast characterized by its muscular body and giant horns.Behemoths
    can't coexist with other behemoths. They will fight to the death if they meet.
    Those that survive this struggle become a King Behemoth. Their roar symbolize
    death, and those who hear it can do little more than sit and pray that the storm
    doesn't come their way.
  summonDesc: Growl! My roar signals <br>the end of a life. <br>Endure it and become
    my master!
  fusionDesc: Roar!!<br>Let my power grow!!
  evoDesc: Lead me to my prey!<br>I will make quick work of it!
